# 🌍 **TerraChain** — Blockchain-Based Land Record Registry

> *"Every square centimeter of earth, immutably owned."*

---

## 📛 Idea Name

### **TerraChain**

**Tagline:** *Precision Land Ownership on an Immutable Ledger*

**Alternative Names:**
- **GeoLedger** — Geographic + Ledger
- **PlotProof** — Plot verification on-chain
- **BhumiBlock** (भूमि = land in Hindi) — Great for Indian context

---

## 💡 The Core Idea (Improved)

### Problem Statement

Land ownership disputes are one of the most common civil disputes globally. In India alone, **66% of all civil cases** are related to land/property disputes. The existing land registry systems suffer from:

- **Forged documents & duplicate registrations**
- **Ambiguous boundaries** (described in vague terms like "near the mango tree")
- **Middlemen & corruption** in registration offices
- **No single source of truth** — multiple departments maintain conflicting records
- **Encroachment detection is reactive**, not proactive

### The TerraChain Solution

TerraChain maps every piece of land to a **high-precision geospatial grid** and records ownership on a **blockchain**, creating an immutable, transparent, and dispute-proof land registry.

#### 🔑 Key Innovation: The GeoHash Grid (1.1 cm² Accuracy)

The Earth's surface is divided into a hierarchical grid where each **1.1 cm × 1.1 cm cell** has a unique identifier derived from its **latitude/longitude coordinates**.

| Precision Level | Cell Size | Use Case |
|----------------|-----------|----------|
| Level 1 | ~5,000 km × 5,000 km | Continent |
| Level 5 | ~5 km × 5 km | District |
| Level 8 | ~38 m × 19 m | Plot (rough) |
| Level 10 | ~1.2 m × 0.6 m | Room-level |
| **Level 12** | **~1.1 cm × 1.1 cm** | **TerraChain Precision** |

A land parcel = **a collection of contiguous 1.1 cm² cells**, each stored as an NFT-like token on-chain.

---

### 🚀 Improved Feature Set

#### Phase 1 — Core Registry
- **Plot Registration:** Owner registers a parcel by defining a polygon on a map. The system converts this polygon into a set of GeoHash-12 cells.
- **Blockchain Anchoring:** Each cell group is minted as an on-chain asset (ERC-721 style NFT). The owner's wallet address = ownership proof.
- **Transfer & Sale:** Ownership transfer is a simple on-chain transaction with government validator approval (multi-sig).
- **Immutable History:** Full audit trail of every ownership change, boundary modification, and dispute resolution — all on-chain.

#### Phase 2 — Intelligence Layer
- **Satellite/Drone Verification:** ML compares registered boundaries with actual satellite/drone imagery to detect:
  - Encroachments
  - Unauthorized construction
  - Land-use violations (e.g., agricultural land converted to commercial)
- **Dispute Detection:** AI flags overlapping claims automatically before they become legal disputes.
- **Valuation Engine:** ML model estimates land value based on location, infrastructure proximity, market trends, and government circle rates.

#### Phase 3 — Ecosystem
- **Government Dashboard:** For revenue departments to approve registrations, resolve flags, and audit records.
- **Citizen Portal:** For citizens to verify ownership, initiate transfers, and raise disputes.
- **Developer API:** For banks (mortgage verification), courts (dispute evidence), and real estate platforms (listing verification).

---

## ⚙️ Tech Stack

### 🏗️ Framework & Frontend

| Layer | Technology | Rationale |
|-------|-----------|-----------|
| **Frontend** | **Next.js 15 (React)** | SSR for SEO, App Router, server actions for form handling |
| **UI Library** | **Shadcn/UI + Tailwind CSS** | Beautiful, accessible components. Rapid prototyping |
| **Maps** | **Mapbox GL JS** or **Leaflet + OpenStreetMap** | High-precision map rendering, custom tile layers, polygon drawing |
| **3D Terrain** | **Deck.gl** or **CesiumJS** | 3D visualization of land parcels on actual terrain |
| **State Management** | **Zustand** | Lightweight, minimal boilerplate |

### ⛓️ Blockchain

| Layer | Technology | Rationale |
|-------|-----------|-----------|
| **Primary Chain** | **Polygon (PoS)** | Low gas fees (~$0.01), Ethereum compatible, fast finality |
| **Smart Contracts** | **Solidity** | ERC-721 for land NFTs, custom registry contract |
| **Development** | **Hardhat** | Testing, deployment, local dev chain |
| **Wallet Integration** | **ethers.js + MetaMask / WalletConnect** | Standard Web3 wallet connectivity |
| **Alternative for Hackathon** | **Hyperledger Fabric** | Permissioned chain — better for govt use-case |

### 🗄️ Database

| Layer | Technology | Rationale |
|-------|-----------|-----------|
| **Primary DB** | **PostgreSQL + PostGIS** | Geospatial queries (ST_Contains, ST_Intersects), polygon storage, spatial indexing |
| **GeoHash Index** | **H3 (Uber's hexagonal grid)** or **S2 Geometry (Google)** | Hierarchical spatial indexing to Level 12 precision |
| **Cache** | **Redis** | Caching frequent geo-lookups, session management |
| **File Storage** | **IPFS / Filecoin** | Decentralized storage for land documents (sale deeds, maps, photos) |
| **Search** | **Elasticsearch** | Full-text search across registration records |

### 🤖 ML / AI

| Layer | Technology | Rationale |
|-------|-----------|-----------|
| **Satellite Image Analysis** | **TensorFlow / PyTorch** | Semantic segmentation to detect land boundaries from satellite imagery |
| **Pre-trained Models** | **Segment Anything Model (SAM)** by Meta | Zero-shot boundary detection |
| **Object Detection** | **YOLOv8** | Detect structures, encroachments on land |
| **Land Valuation** | **XGBoost / LightGBM** | Regression model using location features, infrastructure proximity, market data |
| **OCR** | **Tesseract / Google Vision API** | Digitize existing paper land records |
| **Satellite Data Source** | **Google Earth Engine API** / **Sentinel Hub** | Free/affordable high-resolution satellite imagery |

### 🔌 APIs & Services

| Layer | Technology | Rationale |
|-------|-----------|-----------|
| **Backend API** | **Node.js (Express)** or **FastAPI (Python)** | REST + GraphQL endpoints for the registry |
| **Authentication** | **NextAuth.js + DigiLocker / Aadhaar eKYC** | Indian govt identity verification |
| **Geolocation** | **Google Maps Geocoding API** | Address → lat/lng conversion |
| **Survey Data** | **RTK GPS / CORS Network APIs** | Real-time centimeter-level GPS accuracy |
| **Notifications** | **Firebase Cloud Messaging** | Push alerts for ownership changes, disputes |
| **Payments** | **Razorpay / UPI** | Registration fee payments |
| **Government Integration** | **ULPIN (Unique Land Parcel Identification Number)** | Link with India's existing land ID system |

---

